{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"The main outcome variables were alpha/beta power and SampEn.\",\n    \"The predictability of the LFPs (band-pass filtered between 8–12 Hz for alpha and 13–30 Hz for beta) was analyzed using Sample Entropy 11 (SampEn), a nonlinear measure suitable for physiological time series.\",\n    \"Ambulatory EEG in PD Freezers has demonstrated an increase in central theta oscillations and a decrease in beta entropy in the transition to FOG, which led to the suggestion that cortical activity was ‘less complex’ when PD subjects transitioned from normal walking to freezing ( Handojoseno et al., 2015 ).\",\n    \"Further analysis of STN LFPs during transitions from walking to FOG will help to determine whether this is also seen in subcortical structures.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"The main outcome variables were alpha/beta power and SampEn.\",\n    \"Power was summed in the beta and alpha bands.\",\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"Nonlinear signal analysis demonstrated that SampEn in the beta band was greater during SIP (without FOG) in Freezers compared to Non-Freezers (H(1) = 4.61, P = 0.032).\",\n    \"Freezers also showed increased alpha SampEn during FOG when compared to walking without FOG (F(1, 51) = 7.67, P = 0.005).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法部分有依据，但存在重要的频段限定问题。原文确实研究了 STN 局部场电位（LFP）在步行和冻结步态期间的神经异常，包括 beta 功率、beta Sample Entropy 和 alpha Sample Entropy 的变化，因此可以支持较宽泛的 STN 神经活动复杂性异常与 FOG 有关这一观点。但是，原文分析的 STN LFP 频段是 alpha（8–12 Hz）和 beta（13–30 Hz），没有报告 STN 局部 theta/delta 功率异常，也没有提供相应频段的状态转换证据。尤其需要注意，原文讨论中提及的 theta 振荡来自既往 ambulatory EEG 研究，而非本研究的 STN 局部记录；作者还明确表示，需要进一步分析 STN LFP，才能确定这种现象是否也存在于皮层下结构。因此，该文献可以作为相关背景证据，但不足以直接支持 H4 所限定的 STN 局部 theta/delta 状态转换异常机制，报告若未作此限定，存在证据与假说不匹配的问题。指控者的核心判断有全文依据，但其将原文概括为主要研究 alpha/beta Sample Entropy 不够完整，因为原文也明确将 alpha/beta power 列为主要结局指标，并进行了相应分析。因此 judge_supported 判为 partly，而非 yes。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ef65bacd-6518-41e4-b8ad-63595ddc8703", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070537896372Z", "elapsed_seconds": 158.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:08:16.829052+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "af7c276b709f535a7de4893a465eb1fc5c2e5d7896d72ed9a8fe95efe10338c9", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T070537896372Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "78ddffa416e8c67360cdab4619f578cc8f896457e6bb07d23d4d20f739bbb872"}}}
